#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY"
